    "intro": {
      "zh": "Nintendo Wii 是任天堂 2006 年发布的第七代家用游戏机，以体感遥控器 Wii Remote 与蓝海战略开辟了体感游戏的新纪元，成为现象级主机，是游戏机厅第七代主机「体感革命」叙事线的核心展品。",
      "en": "The Nintendo Wii, released in 2006, was a seventh-generation home console that pioneered motion gaming with its Wii Remote, becoming a phenomenon through its blue-ocean strategy."
    },
    "era": 2006, "manufacturer": "Nintendo"
  },
